    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1.<strong>Class Participation and Assignment: 40% (Class Participation: 10%; Assignment: 30%)</strong></div>\n\n<div>2.<strong>Midterm Report and Presentation: 20%</strong>&nbsp;<strong>(3-4 students/team)</strong></div>\n\n<div>&bull;<strong>Finish the Civil </strong><strong>Service </strong><strong>Examination or </strong><strong>Professional and Technical Examination of One Specific Year&nbsp;(between 2015-2024)</strong></div>\n\n<div>3.<strong>Term Report and Presentation 40%</strong>&nbsp;<strong>(3-4 students/team)</strong></div>\n\n<div>&bull;<strong>Choose one traffic control related topic, conduct analysis and discussion, propose study report, and give 15/20-minute oral presentation (the presentation should include the research topic, problems analysis, literature review, research methods or data collection methods, results discussion, conclusions and suggestions, comments). Please submit the paper report (.</strong><strong>ppt file).</strong></div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1.上課時間要掌握。\n2.有事請假請先說。\n3.打開手機先通報。\n4.不要講話干擾人。\n5.穿著禮儀要得體。\n6.上課討論要積極。\n7.作業繳交要準時。\n8.撰寫作業靠自己。\n9.考試公平一定要。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>任何以您的名義提交的測試、論文或報告都被認為是您自己的原創作品，並且之前未曾在其他課程中提交過的作業、作品、或報告等，除非事先獲得我的批准，每次作業相似度不得超過30%。&nbsp;在您的所有作業中，包括您的家庭作業或論文草稿，您可以引用其他人在出版物、網站或其他來源中撰寫的文字或想法，但必須註明出處。如果您對完成作業、或參加考試或考試的要求不清楚時，請務必事先向老師或TA尋求說明。最後，期望同學作為學生應該在所有學術活動中表現出誠信，完成學習任務。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
